OL,3,GNEWSAPlaque honours activist who helped
OL,4,Athose in need
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn activist described as "a hero" has
OL,7,Fbeen honoured by a blue plaque at the
OL,8,Fsite of a club he set up to help those
OL,9,Fin need.
OL,11,FJohnny Rafferty arrived in Maryport,
OL,12,FCumbria, in 1921 and for 50 years until
OL,13,Fhis death fought for workers' rights
OL,14,Fand support for the unemployed.
OL,16,FThe plaque installed by the town
OL,17,Fcouncil is on the site of the club he
OL,18,Fset up on Senhouse Street in the 1930s,
OL,19,Foffering the unemployed cheap meals and
OL,20,Fentertainment such as films, darts and
OL,21,Fdominoes.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
