OL,3,GNEWSAPlaque honours activist who helped
OL,4,Athose in need
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe town's mayor John Newton said: "In
OL,7,Fthe eyes of many who remember him,
OL,8,FJohnny Rafferty was a hero - [this] is
OL,9,Fa recognition of his contribution to
OL,10,Fthe town."
